{"title":"Warden Lord","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 65 Rime Elemental that attacks with freeze (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 56 total, 56 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×56</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"rime-crystal\" title=\"Rime Crystal - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/582c41ee5ac2654c6a77.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rime Crystal</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1232.0px,-70.1px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/3/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/3/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/4/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/4/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/5/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:1232.0px;top:70.1px\"></i></div><figcaption>Plymouth Wharf</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rime-warden-lord\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Rime Elemental: <a href=\"#/monster/rime-shard\">Rime Shard</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/rime-elemental\">Rime Elemental</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/glacier-warden\">Glacier Warden</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/0849552e77602b23ddf8.svg\" alt=\"Warden Lord\"></div><h3>Warden Lord</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>65</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 65)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Rime Elemental</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>freeze · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>490</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>40.3</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,250</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>3.45</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}